      <title>The AI safety debate is confusing. Here's our guide to the different factions</title>
      <author>Katie McQue</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/09/26/nx-s1-5979085/the-ai-safety-debate-is-confusing-heres-our-guide-to-the-different-factions</link>
