      <title>Pope warns a 'paradise of machines' could undermine humanity as he opens France trip</title>
      <author>The Associated Press</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/09/26/g-s1-145150/pope-warns-a-paradise-of-machines-could-undermine-humanity</link>
