      <title>Roads flood in New Jersey, inundate some homes, as first major signs of nor'easter take shape</title>
      <author>The Associated Press</author>
      <link>https://www.npr.org/2026/09/26/g-s1-145146/roads-flood-in-new-jersey</link>
